<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hwan Yung shr trading halted on rumours.</title>
<headline>Hwan Yung shr trading halted on rumours.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Stock Exchange said on Tuesday it has suspended trading of Hwan Yung Steel Industry Co Ltd shares because of rumours that the company faced default on debt repayment.  </p>
<p>The exchange said in a statement the suspension of trading took effect at 10.45 a.m. (0145 GMT), but did not give further details.</p>
<p>The statement also did not mention when the trading would resume.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
